    "html":  "\u003cdiv class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cb\u003eMithotil\u003c/b\u003e is the strongest metal known in the Queen\u0027s Blade universe.\n\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eIntroduced as early as \u003ca href=\"/wiki/Ymir\" title=\"Ymir\"\u003eYmir\u003c/a\u003e\u0027s battlebook, it\u0027s touted as an expensive and hard mineral, with Ymir claiming that her weapon wouldn\u0027t break unless it clashed with another one similarly made of mithotil (which is ironic, considering how hers is the only weapon that canonically broke through the series, making her end up serving \u003ca href=\"/wiki/Claudette_Vance\" title=\"Claudette Vance\"\u003eClaudette\u003c/a\u003e in \u003ca href=\"/wiki/Queen%27s_Blade:_Rebellion\" title=\"Queen\u0026#39;s Blade: Rebellion\"\u003eQueen\u0027s Blade: Rebellion\u003c/a\u003e).\n\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eBesides its toughness, it also has magical properties. In \u003ca href=\"/wiki/Queen%27s_Blade_Struggle\" title=\"Queen\u0026#39;s Blade Struggle\"\u003eQueen\u0027s Blade Struggle\u003c/a\u003e, it\u0027s claimed that \u003ca href=\"/wiki/Leina\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Leina\"\u003eLeina\u003c/a\u003e\u0027s new sword Evindil \"Wind of Victory\" is made of mithotil, and that could very well be why she\u0027s able to purify \u003ca href=\"/wiki/Aldra\" title=\"Aldra\"\u003eAldra\u003c/a\u003e\u0027s evil and vanquish Delmore with it at the end of the original Queen\u0027s Blade tournament, as stated by a blurb in \u003ca href=\"/wiki/Queen%27s_Blade_Rebellion_Bitoshi_Senki:_Showdown\" title=\"Queen\u0026#39;s Blade Rebellion Bitoshi Senki: Showdown\"\u003eQueen\u0027s Blade Rebellion Bitoshi Senki: Showdown\u003c/a\u003e.\n\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"/wiki/Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited\" title=\"Queen\u0026#39;s Blade Unlimited\"\u003eQueen\u0027s Blade Unlimited\u003c/a\u003e also states its magical properties, having \u003ca href=\"/wiki/Elina\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Elina\"\u003eElina\u003c/a\u003e\u0027s mithotil-made spear be able to easily hurt a wraith such as \u003ca href=\"/wiki/Airi\" title=\"Airi\"\u003eAiri\u003c/a\u003e, claimed to be inmune to normal weapons.\n\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eIn the new series \"Nanashi\u0027s Reincarnation: Queen\u0027s Blade\", this metal also now called \"God Steel\" is known to be the strongest metal beyond platinum, giving its name to the strongest Rank of Beautiful Fighters and candidates to win the fighting tournament.\n\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cspan class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\"\u003eTrivia\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"mw-editsection\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\"\u003e[\u003c/span\u003e\u003ca title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fqueensblade.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FMithotil%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1\u0026amp;uselang=en\u0026amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"\u003e\u003csvg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"\u003e\u003cuse xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cspan class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\"\u003e]\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003eA \"Mithotil Ring\" appears in \u003ca href=\"/wiki/Queen%27s_Blade:_Spiral_Chaos\" title=\"Queen\u0026#39;s Blade: Spiral Chaos\"\u003eQueen\u0027s Blade: Spiral Chaos\u003c/a\u003e, as the strongest ring in the game.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eA \"God Iron\" material appears in \u003ca href=\"/wiki/Queen%27s_Blade:_Knight_Of_The_Unicorn\" title=\"Queen\u0026#39;s Blade: Knight Of The Unicorn\"\u003eQueen\u0027s Blade: Knight Of The Unicorn\u003c/a\u003e as something Ymir is looking for, the material also mentioned in \u003ca href=\"/wiki/Queen%27s_Gate:_Spiral_Chaos\" title=\"Queen\u0026#39;s Gate: Spiral Chaos\"\u003eQueen\u0027s Gate: Spiral Chaos\u003c/a\u003e since the \"God Iron Bracer\" is the second strongest bracer. From the similarity in the names and comparing the relative strength of both Mithotil Ring and God Iron Bracer, it could be assumed that \"God Iron\" is a material that is used in the creation of Mithotil/God Steel.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDespite its status as the strongest material since very early on, only a very few QB stories have explicitly featured it.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eThe name \"mithotil\" itself is widely believed to be a variation of \"mithril\", both strongest metals in their respective universes, probably to avoid any potential copyright issues.\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cspan class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\"\u003eGallery\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"mw-editsection\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\"\u003e[\u003c/span\u003e\u003ca title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fqueensblade.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FMithotil%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2\u0026amp;uselang=en\u0026amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"\u003e\u003csvg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"\u003e\u003cuse xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cspan class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\"\u003e]\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003ctable class=\"\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"width:100%;float:\"\u003e\u003ctbody\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003cth class=\"\u0026#123;\u0026#123;\u0026#123;class\u0026#125;\u0026#125;\u0026#125;\" style=\"padding-ri